# Circuit Components Convention

## Metaphor
Modules and styles mapped as an electrical circuit to specify their systemic roles and how they influence the attention field.

## Component Roles
- **resistor**: Attenuates and slows down propagation (e.g. `haptics.js`).
- **capacitor**: Stores state or charge, releasing it on trigger (e.g. `wonder-memory.js`).
- **inductor**: Builds up resonance momentum over time (e.g. `attention-architecture.js`).
- **transformer**: Transforms signals from one context into another (e.g. `developmental-climate.js`, `canvas-accents.js`).

## Physical Mapping
- **Voltage**: Map to `--charge` state.
- **Current**: Map to `--spw-resonance`.
- **Inductance**: Map to `--spw-attention`.
- **Capacitance**: Map to `--spw-field-balance`.
